This package (`envsync-enterprise` and related proprietary paths) is proprietary
software. It is included in the public monorepo for transparency and dual-license
development (PostHog / Coder style) but is **not** licensed under the MIT License
that applies to core OSS packages.

## Production use

Use of this software in production (including self-hosted enterprise deployments
and hosted EnvSync Cloud) requires a valid EnvSync enterprise subscription or
other written license from EnvSync Cloud.

## What this covers

- Management API module registry and enterprise process packaging
- Enterprise-only features, services, and UI modules associated with this package
  and successor packages (`envsync-management-api`, future `envsync-enterprise-web`)

## What this does not cover

- `envsync-kernel`, `envsync-api` core surface, public deploy tools, and other
  packages explicitly marked MIT remain under their respective MIT licenses.

## Contributions

Contributions to proprietary packages are accepted under terms that assign or
license the contribution to EnvSync Cloud for inclusion under this enterprise
license (see CONTRIBUTING.md when dual-license contribution terms are finalized
in Phase 6).

